MODULE: SwapInvisibleToResolve
TARGET: SwapObserved
CLASS: Invariant
SUMMARY: an alias swap does not advance the topology generation a routing resolve observes, so a walk keeps resolving the retired physical tree
PERTURBS: AliasSwap
BOUNDS: MaxSwap = 1

--- FIND
    /\ epoch' = swapEpoch'
--- REPLACE
    /\ UNCHANGED epoch
--- END